ource `\"<format>\"` |\n| `unpack_array` (pack_unpack.c:621-625) | format ends before `]` — e.g. `\"[\"`, `\"[i\"` | `-1`; `json_error_invalid_format`, `\"Unexpected end of format string\"`, source `\"<format>\"` |\n| `unpack_array` (pack_unpack.c:633-637) | token not in `unpack_value_starters = \"{[siIbfFOon\"` — e.g. `\"[x]\"`, `\"[#]\"`, `\"[%]\"`, `\"[+]\"`, `\"[?]\"` | `-1`; `json_error_invalid_format`, `\"Unexpected format character '%c'\"`, source `\"<format>\"` |\n| `unpack_array` (pack_unpack.c:643-648) | `json_array_get(root, i)` NULL — more format items than array elements | `-1`; `json_error_index_out_of_range`, `\"Array index %lu out of range\"`, source `\"<validation>\"` |\n| `unpack_array` (pack_unpack.c:651-652) | recursive `unpack()` failed | `-1` |\n| `unpack_array` (pack_unpack.c:661-665) | strict and `i != json_array_size(root)` (array longer than format) | `-1`; `json_error_end_of_input_expected`, `\"%li array item(s) left unpacked\"`, source `\"<validation>\"` |\n| `unpack` case `'s'` (pack_unpack.c:680-684) | `root && !json_is_string(root)` | `-1`; `json_error_wrong_type`, `\"Expected string, got %s\"`, source `\"<validation>\"` |\n| `unpack` case `'s'` (pack_unpack.c:690-694) | `const char **` target is NULL (and not `JSON_VALIDATE_ONLY`) | `-1`; `json_error_null_value`, `\"NULL string argument\"`, source `\"<args>\"` |\n| `unpack` case `'s'` + `%` (pack_unpack.c:698-704) | `size_t *` length target is NULL for `\"s%\"` | `-1`; `json_error_null_value`, `\"NULL string length argument\"`, source `\"<args>\"` |\n| `unpack` case `'i'` (pack_unpack.c:717-721) | `root && !json_is_integer(root)` | `-1`; `json_error_wrong_type`, `\"Expected integer, got %s\"` |\n| `unpack` case `'I'` (pack_unpack.c:732-736) | `root && !json_is_integer(root)` | `-1`; `json_error_wrong_type`, `\"Expected integer, got %s\"` |\n| `unpack` case `'b'` (pack_unpack.c:747-751) | `root && !json_is_boolean(root)` | `-1`; `json_error_wrong_type`, `\"Expected true or false, got %